{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0101","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":5,"subject":"math","topic_key":"statistics","total_weight":104,"expected_output":"screening-0101.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2038","source_sha256":"0919d789b3c7a6985fc3503c438c82f15d5894011a8b87fbb6d8a110cdefebb7","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"۴ داده با واریانس ۴ و ۶ داده با واریانس ۱ را با هم در یک گروه قرار داده‌ایم. اگر میانگین داده‌ها در دو دستهٔ ابتدایی برابر هم باشند، واریانس داده‌های جدید کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۳۸","aspect_ratio":12.8367}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.7949}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2/2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.9231}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2/8$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.4872}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.9487}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"واریانس دو گروه را می‌نویسیم:\n$$ \\sigma_1^2 = \\frac{(x_1-\\overline{x})^2 + (x_2-\\overline{x})^2 + \\cdots + (x_4-\\overline{x})^2}{4} = 4 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow (x_1-\\overline{x})^2 + (x_2-\\overline{x})^2 + \\cdots + (x_4-\\overline{x})^2 = 16 $$\n$$ \\sigma_2^2 = \\frac{(y_1-\\overline{x})^2 + (y_2-\\overline{x})^2 + \\cdots + (y_6-\\overline{x})^2}{6} = 1 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow (y_1-\\overline{x})^2 + (y_2-\\overline{x})^2 + \\cdots + (y_6-\\overline{x})^2 = 6 $$\nحال واریانس داده‌های جدید را محاسبه می‌کنیم:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{\\overbrace{(x_1-\\overline{x})^2 + (x_2-\\overline{x})^2 + \\cdots + (x_4-\\overline{x})^2}^{16}}{10} + \\frac{\\overbrace{(y_1-\\overline{x})^2 + (y_2-\\overline{x})^2 + \\cdots + (y_6-\\overline{x})^2}^{6}}{10} = \\frac{22}{10} = 2/2 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۳۸","aspect_ratio":0.2618},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/solution_continuation_7.webp","alt":"ادامه حل سوال ۲۰۳۸","aspect_ratio":0.2359}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/solution_continuation_7.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"fa92868fd6984aece23cfb1bf770a8127cc8430e8802b4b8a4a0a8d3b44a1c07","bytes":2614},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"e7f5fcfbee9bfce8dc0ae6982d2dc7634caa0c3e0eee00954c9c5099fb783648","bytes":2138},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"7023e3d2ad16e9b8d7b82d8c88e6f14471f392f8f945684e43fa60b997e9c934","bytes":2638},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"fffa07cb71461be18a22018d4102299227aa48a75c26ef3c0641e86640239fab","bytes":2816},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/solution_6.webp","sha256":"2af97c087b64ccaf3d9e61965703d05ce4d9716224f9ff376b50c3c1408ef5b1","bytes":15372},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/solution_continuation_7.webp","sha256":"73bd870f5ed9db34bc9642b1db42d3a8162fadbd0ae94baa071c50701ecc9ebe","bytes":5260},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2038/stem_1.webp","sha256":"f4bdcf5772624dd80a48f1bb7caf30634516082f5675ed1b312c2a5ff415e714","bytes":14230}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2038,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":189,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2039","source_sha256":"519c5e0ea36c29235e9134a161156c2e7ae7c5881f280d1e7e9f49ec61284233","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"۶ داده با میانگین ۴ و انحراف معیار ۱ را با ۴ دادهٔ یکسان با مقدار a با هم در یک دسته قرار می‌دهیم. واریانس کل ۶/۶ شده است. مقدار مثبت a چه عدد است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۳۹","aspect_ratio":11.6481}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.7949}],[{"type":"text","text":"$6$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.9231}],[{"type":"text","text":"$8$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.4872}],[{"type":"text","text":"$9$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.9487}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به رابطه $\\sigma^2 = \\frac{\\sum (x_i)^2}{n} - \\overline{x}^2$ مجموع مربعات ۶ داده ابتدایی را به دست می‌آوریم.\n$$ 1 = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^6 x_i^2}{6} - 4^2 \\Rightarrow \\sum_{i=1}^6 x_i^2 = 102 $$\nاگر داده‌های برابر را $a$ بنامیم، واریانس ۱۰ داده جدید را محاسبه می‌کنیم.\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{10} x_i^2}{10} - \\overline{x}^2 \\Rightarrow 6/6 = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^6 x_i^2 + 4a^2}{10} - \\left(\\frac{24+4a}{10}\\right)^2 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow 6/6 = \\frac{102+4a^2}{10} - \\left(\\frac{4a+24}{10}\\right)^2 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow 660 = 1020 + 40a^2 - 16a^2 - 192a - 576 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow 24a^2 - 192a - 216 = 0 \\Rightarrow a^2 - 8a - 9 = 0 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} a = -1 \\text{ ق ق غ } \\\\ a = 9 \\text{ \\checkmark } \\end{cases} $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۳۹","aspect_ratio":0.4528}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"e95bf4f354adaf7c02e35e22d643a2c9d1d30808e31762c6cf61a5cdcb1fc31f","bytes":2316},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"c7f58bdce1917d74b2bbc4a69ad92316e888ccca45c03b20fc66b1dd41e7f1ab","bytes":2006},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"7ca9776c1c735e1d31a575b91ad9b8d74652e356fb7b0f4f9392651bf2c02ece","bytes":182},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"621eb1fd870a3c3838e4d53042318366907e111a3b50b184274feae294fdcf77","bytes":206},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/solution_6.webp","sha256":"e57e14e2f065ab00c0be9ef5229321160c387d7c526dc2f17b449c68f9ad1ed7","bytes":4842},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2039/stem_1.webp","sha256":"f32dae1436e7a1102d96b88ec8cc925bdeba5a6a402cb86bd915ba1145dd62bf","bytes":3760}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2039,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":190,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2040","source_sha256":"6eb257e88de29bcede8fb089962c97bca89b0b2b2b22a9880fbff01fdacab982","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین و واریانس $x_1, x_2, ..., x_{10}$ به ترتیب ۶ و ۴ هستند. میانگین $(x_1 - 1)^2, (x_2 - 1)^2, ..., (x_{10} - 1)^2$ چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۴۰","aspect_ratio":14.2955}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$29$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.7949}],[{"type":"text","text":"$30$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.9231}],[{"type":"text","text":"$39$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.4872}],[{"type":"text","text":"$40$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.9487}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین و واریانس $x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_{10}$ به ترتیب ۶ و ۴ است. بنابراین میانگین و واریانس $(x_1-1), (x_2-1), \\dots, (x_{10}-1)$ برابر ۵ و ۴ می‌باشد.\nدر نتیجه:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{\\sum (x_i-1)^2}{10} - 5^2 = 4 \\Rightarrow \\sum (x_i-1)^2 = 290 $$\nمیانگین موردنظر = $\\frac{290}{10} = 29$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۴۰","aspect_ratio":0.2369}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"122e7d3ce6b5365e0e8b660cf1148309de0325629e7fb21804e73a787b35f8ab","bytes":2318},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"2631cf038f776ca032e7937252d6141da17f0b02aef585edd3c4b986c5ff0ff5","bytes":244},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"5f1ca28c16c537302b0624fb403ddb595609a6cfb2331795d581ade6608c04bb","bytes":176},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"1e0d6dde65658b08ff42994255262a834c23a1ded3ba4694a3145079fbae7e5f","bytes":194},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/solution_6.webp","sha256":"9f3116ed84adf345acc9e2ff90f1e3842494eb6d16d63b7d22c7bba1c9e4ba98","bytes":2328},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2040/stem_1.webp","sha256":"bdc679f4d596d32d30c1524bb4879babb88688bdc9e6f8a8560348b7ea45591c","bytes":12668}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2040,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":190,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2041","source_sha256":"9e55c755bb91a9091622053d5f1812bce6792ed536fedb8992c8dc4becdb3c11","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر واریانس و ضریب تغییرات داده‌های $x_1, x_2, ..., x_5$ به ترتیب ۱ و $\\dfrac{1}{2}$ باشند، حاصل $(2x_1 - 4)^2 + ... + (2x_5 - 4)^2$ چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۴۱","aspect_ratio":11.6481}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{4}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.2245}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.3265}],[{"type":"text","text":"$10$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.8744}],[{"type":"text","text":"$20$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.2222}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"واریانس و ضریب تغییرات $x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_5$ به ترتیب ۱ و $\\frac{1}{2}$ است.\n$$ \\sigma^2=1 \\Rightarrow \\sigma=1 $$\n$$ CV = \\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\sigma}{\\overline{x}} = \\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{\\overline{x}} = \\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow \\overline{x}=2 $$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{(x_1-2)^2 + (x_2-2)^2 + \\cdots + (x_5-2)^2}{5} = 1 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow (x_1-2)^2 + (x_2-2)^2 + \\cdots + (x_5-2)^2 = 5 $$\n$$ \\xrightarrow{\\times 4} 4(x_1-2)^2 + 4(x_2-2)^2 + \\cdots + 4(x_5-2)^2 = 20 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow (2x_1-4)^2 + (2x_2-4)^2 + \\cdots + (2x_5-4)^2 = 20 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۴۱","aspect_ratio":0.3669}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"a2d2e7fcabc74e822851c23d870961304cf9d66e381c46c9172ccc05ba7744fc","bytes":2586},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2041/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"701a72544ff8cb6354183996a4628ec2fa9b1705eb16c6c4f24637af202cd4a8","bytes":