tio":1.6522}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2\\sqrt{2}}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/option_3_6.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6522}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{10}}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/option_4_7.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.942}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ضریب تغییرات دو گروه را به دست می‌آوریم:\nگروه A: $\\overline{x} = \\frac{3+2+1+3+1}{5} = 2$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\sigma^2 = \\frac{1^2+0+1^2+1^2+1^2}{5} = \\frac{4}{5} \\Rightarrow \\sigma = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow CV_1 = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\overline{x}} = \\frac{\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}}{2} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5} $$\nگروه B: $\\overline{x} = \\frac{2+0+1+3+4}{5} = 2$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\sigma^2 = \\frac{0+2^2+1^2+1^2+2^2}{5} = 2 \\Rightarrow \\sigma = \\sqrt{2} $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow CV_2 = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\overline{x}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} $$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$$ \\frac{CV_1}{CV_2} = \\frac{\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}}{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}} = \\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{5}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{5} $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/solution_8.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۴۲","aspect_ratio":0.5783}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/option_1_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/option_2_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/option_3_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/option_4_7.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/solution_8.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/stem_1.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/stem_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/stem_3.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2042/option_1_4.webp","sha256":"becb1cd062f27e33c1a5b790d4ef55cbd6f693a68ab54d55ecd0eba5ede9aa32","bytes":2578}